        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cooper_Landing%2C_Alaska",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Peter Doroshin, a Russian engineer, identified gold prospects as far back as 1848 when the territory was still part of Russian America.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cooper_Landing%2C_Alaska",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The historic Gwin's Lodge is one of the oldest log roadhouses in Alaska and is still in operation today.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
