      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cooper_Landing%2C_Alaska",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1938 a road opened east to Seward, and by 1948 a westward road to Kenai was built, letting residents reach Anchorage by 1951.",
